<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ameritech raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ameritech raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Ameritech Corp to neutral from underperform.</p>
<p>-- said it upgraded regional Bell telephone company stocks to market weight from underperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
